# Granite Witness, cast face down turn 1 from a Black Lotus. Turn 3 it attacks face down (a 2/2 without vigilance, so it taps), then
# after combat is turned face up with two blue mana (Mox Sapphire and an Island pay both hybrid symbols, CR 702.168d). It is the only
# creature, so "target creature" is itself, chosen as the ability goes on the stack, and Untap untaps it (CR 701.26b). Face up it
# is a 3/2 flier with vigilance; Bot2 takes the face-down 2 damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Granite Witness
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Island
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

